window.products.push({"id":1022240,"name":"NC Custom Pillow Custom Pillow with Photos Custom Throw Pillows Couch Pillows Decorative Pillows for Bed Throw Pillows for Couch Customized Double-Sid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aArEm5dvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-quality products, honest sellersAdd color to your life:Each personalized pillow is cut into the shape of your beloved photo. Customized pillows are not only pet-shaped pillows, but can also be made into pillows of other shapes such as human faces, cars, idols, plants, etc. Of course, you can also make human-shaped pillows for your lover in a different place. You can sleep on the pillow, just like a hug. Like him/her, it is a way for couples in different places to accompany each other or to accompany people who live far away or live alone. It is also a great pillow for bedrooms, guest rooms, nurseries, car interiors or living rooms.Your photo + pillow = surprise!Personalized 3D pillows are gifts on Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Christmas, Thanksgiving, Valentine’s Day, Halloween, birthday, graduation ceremony, wedding anniversary, etc. Our emotional pillow may be for parents, children, friends, teachers, etc. The perfect gift. He/she will know that you have put in extra effort to find something better than ordinary gifts! Surprise! ! !We accept mass custom throw pillows and design meaningful pillows for you.size:The measured size is based on the longest side of the photo and depends on the size purchased. The short side is designed based on the same proportion of the size of the provided photo, and strives to achieve perfect size. Each of our 3D custom throw pillows are made by hand. A slight error in size is normal, please understand!Tips: Our products are filled with high-quality PP cotton. Vacuum packaging may shrink due to compression during transportation. Please pick up the plush pillow and shake its whole body vigorously to restore the fullness of the PP cotton.delivery time:Each pillow is customized according to the order and is usually shipped within 3-5 days.After the project is customized, it will take 6-12 days to deliver.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aArEm5dvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\C","source_asin":"B099KDXVMN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1022240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099KDXVMN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099KDXVMN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
