window.products.push({"id":1022265,"name":"Tim HERCULES Curved Triple Braced & Quad Hinged Beige Vinyl Upholstered Metal Folding Chair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iGfhZLPaL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Triple Braced HERCULES Series Folding Chairs are our best folding chairs ever. When in need of temporary seating this heavy duty beige metal frame chair with beige vinyl padded seat and back is perfect. This portable folding chair can be used for Parties, Graduations, Sporting Events, School Functions and in the Classroom. This chair will be the perfect addition in the home when in need of extra seating to accommodate guests. The chair will not take up anywhere near as much space as chairs that cannot fold when it comes time to clean up. This economically priced chair will endure some heavy usage with an 18-gauge steel frame, triple braced and leg strengthening support bars. [HA-MC309AV-BGE-GG]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iGfhZLPaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mercury Furniture","source_asin":"B00LCEH718","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1022265","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LCEH718","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LCEH718","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1022266,"name":"Set of 4 - ChefLand Stainless Steel Soup Ladle Set\"Culinary Standard\" Engineered for Professional And Home Use 2, 4, 6, 8, oz. - Mirror Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61adGXMJeTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Every restaurant, cafe and home kitchen needs a set of good ladles as an essential part of a working kitchen. Serve soups and stews, ladle pancake batter and sauces, or pour a glass of delicious mulled wine with this stainless steel one piece ladle. With a premium mirror finish and dishwasher friendly material, these ladles will provide you with a lifetime of usage for all of your culinary delights. The ladles are not heavy which makes handling each one easier than using a premium-weight ladle. Conveniently store your ladle on a pot rim or hang on a rack with the purposefully crafted hook handle. The variety of sizes provided with this set ensures all of your kitchen ladling requirements will be fulfilled in the most efficient way. For example, the often unincluded 2 ounce ladle is ideal for scooping cream out of whole raw milk in wide mouth jars or skim grease from gravies and sauces. Amazon customers have even noted their innovative use of these ladles to make maintaining consistent mixing ratios for various epoxy and urethanes easy. They allowed them to dip out precise amounts with less gauging error!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61adGXMJeTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChefLand","source_asin":"B00ENKWQW8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1022266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ENKWQW8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ENKWQW8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
