window.products.push({"id":1022497,"name":"KORCCI Milk Frother Handheld, Protein Powder Mixer, Automatic Double Whisk for Coffee, Battery Operated Electric Foamer Maker For Cappuccino, Lattes, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ay9iN14PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Unique New Design, More Efficient] : The milk frother comes with an extra unique dual spring whisk. The handheld milk foam maker, which is comfortable ergonomic design, made of the best quality 18/10 food-safe stainless steel and running with high-speed rotation of the stainless-steel whisk and BPA free shaft, is perfect for versatile use. Ideal gift for your friends and family. [Versatile Mixer, Frother and So Much More] : The efficient milk frother works on all types of milk, creamer, soy, almond, cashew, hazelnut, whole milk, and other dairy such as butter or cream. And you can froth milk, mix hot chocolate, matcha tea, bulletproof coffee, protein powders, matcha, chai tea, whipping egg, mixing other powders. Use it to make milkshakes for your kids or cocktails for your friends. It will work well with both hot and cold liquids. [Easy to Use] : Electric milk frother is very easy to operate. Put in the required batteries(not included) and it is ready to work. (Pay attention to the direction in which the battery is inserted. There is an indication of the battery direction on the surface of the battery case). Take the hot or cold milk in a cup and plunge the frother half way down and power it on. The frother will get to work instantly. Just keep moving the frother up and down. The foam will start forming instantly. [Clean up in Seconds] : After frothing, just put it in fresh or lukewarm running water or soak in water and briefly turn it on to wash. So easy and convenient to clean. The ergonomic smooth base is not meant to be immersed in water, so keep the cleaning to the whisk. [Note]: This milk frother is full of power, reaching up to 19,000 RPM. Good quality alkaline batteries are recommended for maximum power.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ay9iN14PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KORCCI","source_asin":"B0C61FBDPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1022497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C61FBDPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C61FBDPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
