window.products.push({"id":1022556,"name":"Koldfront WTC14001W 14000 BTU 208/230V Through the Wall Air Conditioner with 10600 BTU Heater with Remote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":725.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GTPB6680L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PLEASE NOTE: This product does not ship to California. It is not approved by the California Energy Commission (CEC) for sale in California. 14,000 BTU cooling; 10,600 BTU heating; 700 square feet coverage area; CEER: 9.3 PLEASE NOTE: This is a 230V unit and requires a 230V outlet; Plug type Nema 6-20P Temperature Range: 62° F - 86° F; Sleep mode; 24 hour timer; Energy saver feature; Control panel with digital display; Remote control included; Dehumidifier function; Power cord length 6 1/2 ft Compatible with the Koldfront wall air conditioner sleeve (WTCSLV) sold separately. For this model with the wall sleeve included see model number WTC14001WSLV","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GTPB6680L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Koldfront","source_asin":"B07S4G9WBJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1022556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S4G9WBJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S4G9WBJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1022557,"name":"PAMPAS FOX - 3 Natural Tall Pampas Grass Plants, Cream-White Color with Full Stems (Cortaderia) (48\" / 4ft) Indoor Home Boho Chic Decor for Corner Flo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91u4ecxaD8S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PAMPAS FOX - Boho Chic Decor Pampas grass is claimed to be one of the most trending home decor and wedding prop accessories of 2021, and it’s for a good reason! The beautiful addition of high-quality pampas grass in your home, office, or event instantly creates a sophisticated and elegant ambience; and it doesn’t take a professional interior designer to arrange them.   At PAMPAS FOX, we set the standards for our pampas at top premium quality, and won’t settle for anything less. Our thick and feathery pampas plants have been hand-picked and naturally dried to maintain the natural look and feel of this beautiful plant in nature. Just pair your new pampas with a unique decorative floor vase and voila! You’ve created a beautiful custom display that suits the setting you’ve imagined.  Ideal for baby nurseries, home offices, living rooms, bathrooms, entrances, and bedrooms. Our high-quality pampas grass is also suitable as a home staging prop for interior design or real estate, a wedding decor prop or even a baby-photoshoot prop. KEY FEATURES ∙ 3 X 48” Stems included ( 31” Long X 3.5” Wide Plumes)  ∙ Naturally dried and hand-picked  ∙ 100% genuine pampas  ✔ ∙ Thick and feathery, premium quality  ∙ Pair with other tall indoor artificial plants  ∙ Budget friendly home decor  ∙ Suitable decor for any setting  ∙ Versatile arrangement options  ∙ Beautiful boho chic inspiration  ∙ White cream color pampas grass matches any decor What Is Included? - 3 X (48”/ 4ft) Genuine Pampas Grass Plants  - 1 Care instruction card","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91u4ecxaD8S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pampas Fox","source_asin":"B08Y47B8Z6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1022557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y47B8Z6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y47B8Z6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1022558,"name":"Easy, Tiger 12 oz Gold Foil Stackable Mug (Mrs. Tea)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sjXEqyxoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size: 3.625\" high x 3\" in diameter. Gold foil. Of course. Not a fan of microwaves. Hand wash recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sjXEqyxoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Easy Tiger","source_asin":"B01GW1HV6Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1022558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GW1HV6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GW1HV6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1022559,"name":"Electric Kettle, Tea Kettle With LED Indicator,1.7 L Smart Temperature Control Hot Water Kettle With Removable Infuser, BPA-Free Tea Maker Coffee Pot ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x9j0qBfOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PREMIUM MATERIAL】Our electric kettle is made of high quality borosilicate glass, which is not only beautiful and stylish, but also particularly safe, can withstand high and low temperatures, enough to withstand extreme weather. The inner chassis of the kettle is added with Teflon coating on the basis of stainless steel material, which can prevent the bottom from rusting and isolate harmful substances. The filter element equipped with our kettle is also made of 316 stainless steel, which is safer than 304 stainless steel. 【Smart Temperature Control】 Our kettles can be set to different temperatures for different tea ,the heat preservation time also can be set from 30 minutes to 12 hours, so that you can keep water or tea warm all day, especially in winter, will fill your life with warmth. Other brands of kettles can only keep warm for 30 minutes. 【Easy To Use】You can fully enjoy the convenience and peace of mind .As Kettalk’s kettle build with safety equipment of Auto Shut-Off and boil-dry protection with powerful thermostat technology, otherwise the one-touch rotate switch has a built-in LED indicator for easy operation even at night.The conspicuous blue light in the kettle will light up when the water starts to boil and go off after completing the task,so you can leave and focus on other things. 【With Removable Infuser】The Kettalk kettle comes with a removable filter, which is composed of two layers of stainless steel，the inner layer of extremely fine stainless steel, which can filter particles and residues such as tea and coffee, allowing you to drink more delicate and more delicious. Remove the filter can be used to boil water, eggs, etc. The cost of one kettle allows you to enjoy the convenience of multiple functions. 【More User-friendly Design】Specially design the non-drip V-shaped spout for easily controlling the flow, 4.7 inch wide diameter and detachable lid, can be cleaned 360 degrees without dead ends, making it more convenient to wash and receive water.More intimate after-sales:We provide 6 months unconditional replacement service and 2 years free maintenance service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x9j0qBfOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kettalk","source_asin":"B0BFCMWT5D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1022559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFCMWT5D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFCMWT5D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
