window.products.push({"id":1022600,"name":"ECRABONE Mirror Alarm Clock, 6.5 Inch Digit Display, Adjustable Brightness, USB Powered, Night Light, Vibration Alert, Easy to Set Up, Simplicity Digi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-1h4ZjjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Feature： 1.LED time display 2.There are 3 levels of brightness 3.Night mode with automatic dimming 4.Total 4 functional buttons: \"M\"- Mode button; \"+\"-Up button; \"-\" -Down button, \"SNOOZE\" 5.Two kinds of time mode option (12/24 hour modes selectable ) 6.The default Alarm display is 6:00 7.Alarm with pre-settable Snooze function (5 minutes ) 8.Snooze last for 5-60 minutes and unlimited times 9.Power supply: when powered by DC power, the LED is long bright and all function are normal when powered by built-in button cell, the LED light is off and no display, but can keep the time normal walking and original setting 10.There are 2 USB output ports on the side (5V, 1A) which allows you to charge android or apple system smart phone in the same time Notes 1. Some scratches appear on the protective film due to long-distance transportation, please tear the protective film off before using (tips: as our protective film is very thin and fit well, which requires a little patience to find it and tear off) 2.Please remove plastic insulator tab from battery compartment in the back and connect the product with electricity by USB or adapter 3.if time mode is 12 hour mode, when is afternoon time, there is \"PM\" symbol in display, when is morning time, there is no \"PM\" symbol in display 4.Auto brightness mode and night mode cannot be turned on simultaneously 5.Backup battery just maintains memory, not for power the clock Package including: 1 * night light vibrating mirror Clock 1 * Charging Cord 1 * User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-1h4ZjjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECRABONE","source_asin":"B09PV8QKYL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1022600","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PV8QKYL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PV8QKYL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
