window.products.push({"id":1022602,"name":"PIPE DECOR 30” Solid Wood Wall-Mounted Rack with 4 Hooks, Industrial Wall-Mounted Coat Rack, Boulder Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IB6drRA+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PIPE DECOR’s wall-mounted hook rack flawlessly combines form and function. Make use of your blank walls by adding a simple storage solution without taking up much space. The combination of metal pipes and wooden boards provides a rustic, industrial look, making it as unique as it is useful. Use it as a clothes rack in your bedroom, a towel rack in your bathroom, a pot rack in the kitchen, a coat rack in the hallway, or a place to hang your tools in the garage. The stylish design ensures that it will perfectly suit any room or commercial space. Here at PIPE DECOR, we believe that your furniture can be both sophisticated and sustainable. Unlike what you’ll find at big box stores, this is not commercially mass-produced pressboard. Our wood is ethically harvested right here in North America. When paired with real pipes and fittings, you can create an heirloom accent that will stand the test of time. The rich color is a result of our unique finishing process which enhances the existing characteristics of each shelf. Every knot becomes a beautiful accent, while the natural wood grain offers organic movement to the finished piece. You will know PIPE DECOR parts and accessories when you hold them. Beauty and beast. Strength and style. Accept no substitutes. Components are coated in a light industrial oil to prevent rusting. Easy clean and seal instructions are included. Ask us anything. The PIPE DECOR team is standing by to help you with any questions or concerns. We're happy to assist with product inquiries or instructions, and if there's a problem with your order, we want to make it right. Contact us through the Buyer-Seller Messaging Service. Manufacturer part no. 370HK4WD30BB","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IB6drRA+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PIPE DECOR","source_asin":"B0BHBVV2T2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1022602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHBVV2T2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHBVV2T2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
