window.products.push({"id":1022651,"name":"100 Sets Metal Large Skeleton Key Bottle Openers Bulk Wedding Favor Souvenir Gift Set Pillow Shape Candy Box Escort Tag Card French Ribbon and Sticker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y5uSiHbJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The words on the products just shown the wishes, not as trade marks.  How to make it a beautiful gift: 1. Pile up the pillow box, make one side closed while the other side open. 2. Fill in some candies or butter, or even a scratch photo of Mr and Mrs in the box. 3. Close the other side of the pillow box while finishing filling. 4. Write down your wishes to your dearest friends and guests on the white gift tag. 5. At same time, sticking prepared sticker on the tag. 6. Cut suitable length of ribbon (0.5 yards suggested) 7. Thread the gift tag first, then thread the key opener with the ribbon. 8. Tie the pillow box with the ribbon, and made a beautiful bowknot. 9. Glue is not suggested for the pillow box, the ribbon will tie them up nicely.  Gift tags: Shape: rectangular with love-heart hallow-out Size: 3.5 x 1.6 inches Functions: can be adapted with markers/stamps or ink Suitable for wedding, graduation, party, cloth tags, price tags, gift tags, bookmark tags, cupcake toppers, wish trees, love notes, scrap booking, etc.  Lovely sticker: We are elaborate the stickers for your unique wedding, anniversary and so on. Writing romantic words. Color: kraft background and back letter Size: 1.8 x 1 inch/ 4.5 x 2.5 cm  The rope: Feature: single sided Color: kraft Size: 1.5 mm diameter and each roll total length is 30 meter  Note: Ribbon/Rope is sent in a roll, you may cut a suitable length by yourself, suggested length is 0.5 yards each.Be careful when using scissors.  Package includes: 100 x Sticker 100 x Kraft pillow boxes 100 x Antique copper key bottle openers 100 x Kraft tags with love-heart hallow-out 2 Rolls of 30 meter flax rope in kraft color","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y5uSiHbJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boao","source_asin":"B07RP6N8ZH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1022651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RP6N8ZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RP6N8ZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
