window.products.push({"id":1022682,"name":"PASSOVER TABLE CLOTH WITH MATCHING MATZAH COVER SET - MACHINE WASHABLE RECTANGLE TABLECLOTH SET WITH A PESACH MESSAGE IN HEBREW -  BEAUTIFUL DESIGN TO","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Yvnjz6LDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lighten up your Pesach Holiday with a one of kind Passover Tablecloth Matzah Cover Set! Passover is a holiday dedicated to remembering the Exodus of the Jewish Nation from slavery in Egypt. Our unique table cloth is printed with a special Hebrew message to remind ourselves we personally left slavery in Egypt. The literal translation of the message in Hebrew is:\" In every generation, one must look upon himself as if he personally had gone out of Egypt.\" Exodus 13:8 & includes the three key words of the holiday - \" Pesach Matzah Maror \" This cotton-linen blend table cover and matza holder is designed to create an elegant Passover Seder for the record books! Have a special holiday with easy cleanup, both our table linen and matzoh covers are machine washable . Simply wash and remove from the dryer right when ready to avoid ironing. No need to be worried about your Passover kids ruining your tablecloth and cut down on your clean up time . These sets make for distinctive Passover gifts , the dark brown letters stand out with the beautiful cream-colored background to provide a modern upscale look. A dining table cloth and Matzot cover set suitable for any table size! Just scroll up and see for yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Yvnjz6LDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Broderies de France","source_asin":"B0854MGDN5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1022682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0854MGDN5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0854MGDN5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
