window.products.push({"id":1022790,"name":"Champagne Flutes Glasses Set of 2,Hand Blown Non-lead Premium Crystal, Spiral Stem Special Design Wedding Flutes Great for Anniversary, Birthday, Chri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S1Wi3ZZWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Authentic Hand Blown: Crafting handmade crystal glasses only, is ROVSYA's exclusive brand! For many years, every ROVSYA champagne glass has been mouth-blown and hand-made by craftsmen with more than 10 years of blowing experience. Compared with usually hand-made flutes, our crystal champagne flutes are lighter and more translucent. Holding it in your hand is like drinking through the air. Sparkling Lead-free Premium Crystal: With the most skilled craftsmen and the best raw materials, ROVSYA has always strived for perfection. By eliminating the lead content from the crystal glass composition, our glass is replaced with fine TITANIUM CRYSTAL through a patented chemical formulation that produces ultra CLEAR, pure and bright wine glasses. The champagne flute is nearly transparent, both visually and physically and you can see the DNA of the champagne through the flute. Unique Interwoven Stem Design: The unique shape will impress your guests. Our stem of this crystal glass is interwoven by 4 crystal strips, which effectively prevents the flutes from falling off your hand. The narrow mouth is also more conducive to enjoying the aroma of lemon, grapefruit and other fruits in your favorite wines. Exquisite Packaging Gift-Choose a good gift is important ：Not only do our champagne flutes have a charming design, our packaging is also very eye-catching. You will definitely be impressed by the luxurious packaging with our signature Champagne Bow. The inner black high-end sponge firmly fixes each glass in its original position, ensuring that it arrives intact. Great for weddings, birthday parties, Christmas and anniversaries. Completely New Quality Control Team and Replacement Guarantee: We've listened to our customers, from their reviews, and have realized the broken problem. Therefore, we specifically set up a QC team to supervise the quality of each glass and test the impact resistance of the packaging. If you receive a broken glass, we will provide you a replacement for free. We learn and improve. For any questions and suggestions, please let us know. We welcome your advice!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S1Wi3ZZWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UDISON","source_asin":"B08L14LBTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1022790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L14LBTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L14LBTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
